{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its siting in\r\nlocal surface water flood zones 3a, in the absence of an adequate Flood Risk\r\nAssessment to assess the future impacts and provide adequate mitigation\r\nmeasures, and in the absence of information demonstrating the proposal would\r\nnot damage the adjacent piped watercourse, would be likely to result in the\r\ndisplacement of water onto adjacent land and fail to provide resilience to\r\nflooding, and would be likely to result in harm to the adjacent watercourse, to\r\nthe detriment of the safety of future occupiers of the application site and\r\nadjacent sites, contrary to policies SI 12 and SI 13 of The London Plan (2021),\r\n&amp;nbsp;policy CS1.U of the Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), and policies DM9, DM10 and DM11.D of the Harrow Development Management\r\nPolicies Local Plan (2013).&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;The proposed dwelling, by reason of its shortfall in the\r\nminimum total gross internal floor area, would result in an overall cramped and\r\nsubstandard quality of living accommodation for the future occupiers of the dwelling\r\n&amp;nbsp;and would fail to provide a fit for\r\npurpose residential unit of an appropriate design, quality and layout, contrary\r\nto Policies D3.D(7) and D6 of The London Plan (2021), policies DM1 (D.(g)) and\r\nDM26 (A.(a) and (c))&amp;nbsp; of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the Technical Housing\r\nStandards Nationally Described Space Standards (2015), the Mayor of London\r\nSupplementary Planning Guidance (2016), and the adopted Residential Design\r\nGuide Supplementary Planning Document (2010)&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
